<section class="explainer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="explainer-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:1rem;">The Dawn Difference</p>
      <div class="hairline"></div>
      <p>Planning a trip should feel exciting — not like a second job. But for most people, the research phase is exhausting: too many options, too many opinions, and no clear way to know which choice is actually the right one for them.</p>
      <p>Dawn Owens built her travel agency around a different approach. Instead of handing you a list, she listens to what you want and tells you what she'd book — then handles every detail through a personalized itinerary delivered before you leave.</p>
      <p>Her clients show up to their trips fully prepared, completely relaxed, and ready to enjoy every moment. The word they use, over and over, is seamless. That's not an accident — it's the whole point.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
